flowchart LR
    Message[Persisted channel or DM message] --> Unread[Unread range uses created_at and id]
    Message --> Parser[Parse distinct normalized handle tokens]
    Parser --> Mentionable{Eligible in this conversation?}
    Mentionable -->|Yes| Mention[Persist stable participant mention]
    Mentionable -->|No| Text[Keep token as ordinary text]

    Cursor[(Participant read cursor)] --> Counts[Authorized activity count RPC]
    Unread --> Counts
    Mention --> Counts
    Access[Current public, team, or DM authorization] --> Counts
    Counts --> Safe[Count-only conversation summary]
    Safe --> Provider[Session-scoped ChatUnreadProvider]
    Provider --> Channel[Channel and team badges]
    Provider --> Direct[DM thread badges]
    Provider --> Navigation[Aggregate chat navigation badges]
    Provider --> Status[Zero, loading, refresh, and error states]

    Open[Open authorized conversation] --> Mark[Server-confirmed mark-read]
    Mark --> Cursor
    Mark --> Reconcile[Refresh authorized summary]
    Reconcile --> Provider

    Notification[US-021 notification records] -.-> Pattern[Badge and accessibility conventions only]
    Pattern -.-> Provider
    Separate[No WebSocket or constant per-channel polling] -.-> Provider

